eenshots01.png", "id": "235918228322285", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974469_235918231655618_9200480916509836758_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=re1FFutkDasQ7kNvwF_kBN3&_nc_oc=AdnHHIDfAmsceN9KZdDZS1s1w28b_GY6IO2AVfXWo-ulqIP0aOQr4G3F8deBZd8SgE4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afym0TyIbl_B4b80_14gWaUxLPm9ATtdgikRFdI-w34rog&oe=69B2CF1C"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots02.png", "id": "1202634946843386", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982715_1202634950176719_6841690957288523386_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8jd1p6ugrmsQ7kNvwEvw3Ex&_nc_oc=AdmefNpt-rPMjU4EOefWnf5fnooslqTCqG8UJTQ8U8oMXxmneAo5K7zDBi2rzVM2RHE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwbyFJAdvli8fnJ8Sk2ha3oBU9mn_5n9DE1BOyjQtxvUw&oe=69B2A9A5"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots13.png", "id": "528250488391317", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001721_528250491724650_1577659830106612444_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ADqqCO0z2bYQ7kNvwGmYE1Z&_nc_oc=AdnhTx8MIrExrfzro3aHrTBex6k30hPXBRkVwWmWqRN5kRtMdpl43OECJ-tve-dDB7w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwHjSNWxrYJpWfi-5YSUZlw6tpaQuIfykrStYhjUKwr1A&oe=69B29DEC"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots10.png", "id": "326371915829001", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974680_326371919162334_129873048362627550_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xqbnDc2r17UQ7kNvwGYt1qG&_nc_oc=AdmG5j0KdIZuJ2JJ8GvI7QPBR2YXDP_IkNE3iZZGn2oHIZ-KwoWu2XurG9qei_vHP0o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwUCD59-yCTDGYocKVSN-LEdQHDZlPdHnQwXB9vVuQSAA&oe=69B2A3AF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "OculusCover2560x1440VIDEOENDSLATEWITHLEGAL.png", "id": "321306219352083", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035305_321306222685416_4438699296036008856_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8lK48Fr2Zp4Q7kNvwFGrm_m&_nc_oc=Adlw6kSr-Kvm8O77bKQukNiAtROS8r5c-eO-wd3GfSmEI2x-5J1IFZb94vJRKw3Xebs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxEr9oK7pMK6_4eNJb6mS7OKyEUgRdldTAjsKk9FAEjqQ&oe=69B2C356"}, "display_name": "Sam and Max: This Time It's Virtual!", "keywords": ["Comedy", "Adventure", "Narrative", "Action", "Arcade"], "long_description": "Sam is a dog with a hat.  Max is a hyperkinetic naked rabbity thing.  Together, they\u2019re the Freelance Police, the intergalactically famous agents of indiscriminately applied justice, now starring in their umpteenth video game, Sam & Max: This Time It\u2019s Virtual!  Even multimedia evil-slappers like Sam & Max could use a hand, and this time they\u2019re using the incomprehensible magic of virtual reality to invite the player into their off-kilter world for a furious day of monster-slaying, obstacle courses, responsibly discharged firearms, and, of course, saving the entire freaking world.\nKey features:\n\u2022Discover the horrible and socially relevant secrets lurking behind, under, and within Cap\u2019n Aquabear\u2019s rotting theme park!\n\u2022Push yourself to be the best of the best of the middling, as a dog and a naked rabbity thing harangue and cajole you through a bewildering assortment of Freelance Police Academy training challenges.\n\u2022Immersion so real you can feel Sam\u2019s breath on your neck!\n", "short_description": "Sam is a dog in a suit.  Max is his naked rabbity partner.  Together, they\u2019re the Freelance Police.  Jump into the not-quite-right world of Sam & Max via the wonder science of virtual reality, and join the multimedia darlings in their never-ending quest to slap the stupid grin off the face of evil."}]}, "developer_name": "HappyGiant", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://happygiant.com/terms-of-service", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://happygiant.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_nam